  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/upZiz61.png\" alt=\"烟囱烟囱\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">添加了<strong>砖、圆石、石砖、泥砖、铁、铜</strong>和<strong>陶瓦</strong>材质的烟囱，它们能产生烟雾粒子效果。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H4YUooO.png\" alt=\"特性展示\" width=\"1000\" height=\"774\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">烟囱模组（Sooty Chimneys）已在<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Boodlyneck\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boodlyneck</a>的视频中亮相（视频时间戳 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ICobJ1QU598&amp;t=293s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">4:52</a>）：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ICobJ1QU598?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">•</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在 Fabric 1.20 及以下版本游玩？这里有移植版本：</span>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sooty Chimneys for Fabric</a>，由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/otomir23/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">otomir23</a>&nbsp;制作</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord服务器\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜欢这个模组？您的支持将使我能够继续开发它以及其他模组！</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon赞助\" width=\"550\" height=\"108\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal.png\" alt=\"PayPal捐赠\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">看看我的其他模组：</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Exposure（曝光）\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"Envelope（信封）\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"Chalk（粉笔）\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"Wares（商品）\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"Monobank（独角银行）\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"Thief（小偷）\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"Salt（盐）\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"Scholar（学者）\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"Horseman（骑马者）\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
